### 11. Get Documents for Application
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?application_id={{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
### 12. Get Documents - No Application ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 13. Get Documents - Invalid Application ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?application_id=invalid-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 14. Get Documents - Other User's Application (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?application_id={{otherApplicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 15. Get Documents - No Authorization
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?application_id={{applicationId}}

### 16. Get Specific Document by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 17. Get Document - Invalid Document ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/invalid-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 18. Get Document - Non-existent Document ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 19. Get Document - Other User's Document (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{otherDocumentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 20. Get Document Download URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 21. Get Document Download URL - Invalid ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/invalid-uuid/download
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 22. Get Document Download URL - No Authorization
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/download

### 23. Direct File Access through Nginx Storage Proxy
### Use the download URL returned from test #20
GET http://localhost:5000/storage/documents/{{filename}}

### 24. Direct File Access - Invalid Filename
GET http://localhost:5000/storage/documents/nonexistent-file.pdf



